      "description": "Details - Indigenous Employment Program- Expression of Interest, La Trobe University Existing application login Jobs at La Trobe Jobs home Current vacancies Working at La Trobe Overseas applicants Our employment strategies Details - Indigenous Employment Program- Expression of Interest Indigenous Employment Program- Expression of Interest Job No.: 544876 Work type: Continuing, Fixed Term La Trobe University is strongly committed to providing employment opportunities to Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander peoples in all academic and professional roles and levels. Indigenous Australian candidates can register an Expression of Interest for consideration and notification of roles that may become available in the future. These details will remain on file for a period of twelve (12) months and actively matched against any suitable position that may arise during that time. Indigenous employment enquiries may be forwarded to the La Trobe Recruitment Team via email at Recruitment@latrobe.edu.au Advertised: 23/1/2011 Closing Date: Back to search results Apply now Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Great, we can send you jobs like this, if this is your first time signing up, please check your inbox to confirm your subscription. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Job Location Date Closes Indigenous Employment Program- Expression of Interest Campus Independent Indigenous Australian candidates; register your Expression of Interest here to receive regular job vacancy information at La Trobe University. General Expressions Of Interest Senior Officer, Customer Care (ASK La Trobe) Work collaboratively within the team and as a member of the ASK La Trobe to facilitate efficient and effective customer service delivery to students and administrative support staff in the University. More details... Casual Campaign